      <title>睡眠不足可能会降低我们对威胁的适应能力，从而导致焦虑</title>
      <link>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2586177-lack-of-sleep-may-cause-anxiety-by-making-us-less-adaptable-to-threats/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</link>
      <description><![CDATA[整晚睡眠不足的人似乎不适应处于潜在威胁的空间，这可能有助于解释缺乏睡眠和焦虑之间的联系]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2586177-lack-of-sleep-may-cause-anxiety-by-making-us-less-adaptable-to-threats/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</guid>
