      <title>为什么消除无理数会引发量子理论的革命</title>
      <link>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2584541-why-banishing-irrational-numbers-could-trigger-a-revolution-in-quantum-theory/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</link>
      <description><![CDATA[一个世纪以来，无理数一直是量子力学的基础。去除它们可能会消除其最奇怪的特征，并引发自量子理论开始以来物理学中最大的剧变]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2584541-why-banishing-irrational-numbers-could-trigger-a-revolution-in-quantum-theory/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
