      <title>糖尿病药物二甲双胍可将痴呆风险降低一半</title>
      <link>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2586113-diabetes-drug-metformin-may-halve-the-risk-of-dementia/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</link>
      <description><![CDATA[服用二甲双胍（一种 2 型糖尿病药物）与在接下来的几十年中降低患痴呆症的风险有关，但这种关联尚不明确]]></description>
