    <item>
      <title>你到底需要喝多少水才能保持大脑敏锐？</title>
      <link>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2586088-how-much-water-do-you-really-need-to-drink-to-keep-your-brain-sharp/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</link>
      <description><![CDATA[水对于良好的大脑功能至关重要，一些令人信服的研究表明，从认知角度来说，脱水可能会减慢你的速度。专栏作家海伦·汤姆森探讨了我们应该喝多少水才能保持敏锐]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.newscientist.com/article/2586088-how-much-water-do-you-really-need-to-drink-to-keep-your-brain-sharp/?utm_campaign=RSS|NSNS&amp;utm_content=home&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_source=NSNS</guid>
